From 47f04064e16b5e4a6e24ab7cccef611363d5fac2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sgt.Bilko" <59089219+SgtBilko76@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:21:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/44] RRV bridge: Vulkan direct present
 (pcsx2-gs-bridge-linux.patch)

Fukami tools/patches/pcsx2-gs-bridge-linux.patch on ARMSX2: direct-present
count, GS-thread wait attribution, acquire helper thread, TFX pipeline
front cache and the XXH3 block hash. Merged with ARMSX2's own
instrumentation: present/acquire stats and the bounded 2 s acquire timeout
stay, the RRV timers wrap the same calls; the pipeline front cache sits in
front of ARMSX2's timed compile and periodic pipeline-cache flush; the
SW-prim timer opens ARMSX2's refactored SwPrimRender.
